(window.ASTRO_TEXT=window.ASTRO_TEXT||{}).en={"pis":{"sun.aries":"You are the kind who acts first and thinks later, and you are often right. There is an eternal pioneer in you: standing still is boring, you are drawn to where there is movement and challenge. You sometimes drop what you started once the thrill cools down.","sun.taurus":"Nobody can move you unless you want to move, and that is your quiet strength. You like things around you reliable, beautiful and tasty, and you build your life slowly but seriously. Your stubbornness is legendary, just ask anyone close to you.","sun.gemini":"Everything interests you, and it shows: a dozen topics are always spinning in your head at once. You are quick to get going and quick with words, but you scatter yourself just as easily. More than anything you are afraid of being bored.","sun.cancer":"You read people through and through and look after your own like few others can. On the outside you may seem prickly, but that is just a shell, inside you are soft and deeply attached. You need a place to come back to.","sun.leo":"There is a light in you that draws people, and you feel it. You need to be noticed, not out of vanity, but because you sincerely want to give warmth. When you believe in yourself, people follow you without thinking twice.","sun.virgo":"You see what others miss and cannot walk past sloppy work. You feel calm when everything is in its place and done properly. The one trouble: you are harder on yourself than on anyone else, time to go easier.","sun.libra":"You were made for \"us\": you bloom around people and wither in conflict. Beauty, peace and fairness around you matter, and you know how to create them. Just don't forget to ask what you want yourself amid all the shared interests.","sun.scorpio":"You live at full depth: half-tones are not for you, only all the way. There is will and inner darkness in you that others avoid, and you know how to live with them. Crises that break others only make you stronger.","sun.sagittarius":"You need space: in thoughts, in plans, in life; you knock down limits on autopilot. You believe in the best and infect others with it, you reach for meaning and far horizons. Sometimes you promise more than you manage, but the road matters more to you than the finish.","sun.capricorn":"You go after what is yours steadily, step by step, and you can wait as long as it takes. People can rely on you: you keep your word and carry the load. Just don't turn life into an endless \"earn it first\", rest is allowed too.","sun.aquarius":"You are your own person and proud of it, doing things like everyone else feels physically wrong. You have your own lens, ideas a bit ahead of their time and a pull towards kindred spirits. A little chill sometimes hides behind your independence, but that is just you.","sun.pisces":"You feel the world more finely than others and live half in a dream. You have a lot of compassion and imagination, but your boundaries blur easily and other people's feelings become yours. Sometimes you need to bring yourself back to yourself: through silence, water, creativity.","moon.aries":"Your emotions flare up instantly and let go just as fast. It is easier for you to blow off steam through action than to sort out feelings in words. On the plus side, you don't hold grudges: you flare up, let go and move on.","moon.taurus":"You recover through simple warm things: a good meal, a hug, familiar comfort. Sudden changes knock you off balance: you need solid ground under your feet. It is calm to be around you, and you radiate that calm yourself.","moon.gemini":"You need to talk things through to understand what you actually feel. Your mood is changeable and curious, and you get bored more often than sad. Find someone to talk to, and your heart feels lighter right away.","moon.cancer":"You feel deeply and remember for a long time, both the good and the hurt. You truly need your own nest, your own people and the feeling that someone will look after you. You care so much yourself that you sometimes overdo it, but that comes from love.","moon.leo":"You need your feelings to be noticed: warmth brings you to life, indifference freezes you. You are generous with heart when you feel loved. And when you don't, you can fade, even if you won't show it.","moon.virgo":"You calm down by putting things in order: in tasks, in lists, in your room. You quiet anxiety by being useful: keep your hands busy, and it lets go. Just don't judge yourself so harshly, you already try harder than most.","moon.libra":"Your inner calm depends on harmony outside: someone else's quarrel throws you off for a long time, and beauty heals. You feel good in a pair and in agreement, it is harder alone. You are a peacemaker by nature, even when you are tired of being one.","moon.scorpio":"Your feelings are deep and tightly closed: either all the way down or a wall. You don't hand out trust left and right, but you are truly loyal to your own. You need absolute reliability next to you and won't settle for less.","moon.sagittarius":"To breathe out you need space, movement and a sense of freedom. Four walls and dull routine make you wilt. Optimism is your armour: you can believe in the best even on rotten days.","moon.capricorn":"You keep your feelings to yourself, not from coldness, but because it feels safer. You look for support in work and responsibility rather than in big words. Let yourself be weak sometimes, at least with your own people, you have that right.","moon.aquarius":"You live your emotions as if from slightly outside, and that feels calmer. Freedom matters more than closeness, but loneliness still slowly wears you down. You warm up among kindred spirits rather than blood relatives.","moon.pisces":"You soak up other people's moods like a sponge and don't always know what is yours and what is not. You need silence, water, music: to drain what has built up and come back to yourself. Your compassion is both a gift and the thing that wears you out.","mercury.aries":"You think fast and say the truth straight out, diplomacy is not your strong suit. You make decisions on the fly: sometimes brilliantly, sometimes rashly. Long warm-ups and empty talk drive you mad.","mercury.taurus":"You think slowly but thoroughly, and changing your mind is almost impossible. You need to touch and check things rather than take them on faith. Once you've said it, it's settled, your word carries weight.","mercury.gemini":"Your mind flies and switches, there are many words and all of them at work. You love connections, conversations and new things just out of interest. The downside: you skim the surface and find it hard to focus on one thing.","mercury.cancer":"You think with your feelings: what matters is not only what is said but who says it. Your logic runs on \"it resonates / it doesn't\". Intuition often tells you more accurately than cold calculation.","mercury.leo":"You speak brightly and confidently and like being listened to. You present your opinion as a fact and know how to fire people up with words. Admitting you are wrong is hard, but that is a small thing next to your charisma.","mercury.virgo":"Your mind works like a scanner: it catches details, errors and inconsistencies on autopilot. You think precisely and practically, but sometimes drown in small things and self-criticism. You feel calmer when everything is sorted into its place.","mercury.libra":"You weigh both sides before deciding, hence both the gift of a diplomat and the endless swinging back and forth. It is easier for you to think out loud and with someone. Fairness is not an empty word for you, you really look for it.","mercury.scorpio":"Your mind digs to the very bottom and senses a hidden layer where others see a smooth surface. Your words are precise and can cut if you choose. You don't take things on faith: you need to dig it out yourself.","mercury.sagittarius":"You think broadly: in ideas, meanings, the big picture, and details can wait. You are drawn to teach, to argue about important things and to win others over to your view. Sometimes you generalise where precision is needed.","mercury.capricorn":"Your mind is strategic: you think in goals, results and ahead of time. Your humour is dry, your words are to the point, nothing extra slips out. You speak rarely but hit the mark.","mercury.aquarius":"You reach conclusions in leaps and see what others overlooked. Your own logic is dearer to you than the accepted one. You are drawn to unusual ideas and a view into tomorrow.","mercury.pisces":"You think in images and hunches rather than in bullet points, and you catch the meaning between the lines. Dry facts and numbers slip away from you. It is easier for you to feel the answer than to explain where it came from.","venus.aries":"In love you are a passionate hunter: you need fire, challenge and the chase itself. You flare up brightly, but without movement you cool down fast. Waiting and dropping hints is not your thing, you go straight for it.","venus.taurus":"You love reliably, physically and faithfully, you need warmth and presence, not words. You value beautiful, tangible things and are a little jealous of what is yours. Love with you feels calm and real.","venus.gemini":"You fall for a mind and a conversation, you need light, lively, changing flirting. Boredom kills feelings faster than any quarrel. Put an interesting person in front of you, and you are already hooked.","venus.cancer":"You love by caring and protecting: you need closeness, a home and the feeling of \"we belong together\". You get attached deeply, seriously and for a long time. Tender but also vulnerable: your heart needs careful handling.","venus.leo":"You love generously and a little for show, you give big and expect admiration in return. You need to be proud of your person. When you love, the whole world finds out.","venus.virgo":"You show love through deeds rather than big gestures: helping, remembering, taking care of small things. Modest, attentive and reliable. Just don't nitpick, neither at yourself nor at the one you love.","venus.libra":"For you love is almost an art: beauty, tact, equality, everything grown-up and graceful. You are made for a couple and handle loneliness badly. For the sake of harmony you are ready to give in, sometimes even too much.","venus.scorpio":"You love deeply, passionately and without half-tones, you need the whole person. Jealousy comes with the package, no point denying it. The superficial leaves you cold: all or nothing.","venus.sagittarius":"You love freely and with a lift, shared adventures mean more to you than vows and rules. You can't stand cages and control at all. Being with you is easy and spacious, as long as nobody tries to tie you down.","venus.capricorn":"You love seriously and for the long run: you test feelings with time and deeds, not words. You need a reliable person and a clear future. You are in no hurry, but once you choose, it is for real.","venus.aquarius":"You love in an unusual way, your own way: friendship and freedom in a couple matter to you as much as passion. You need a like-minded person, not just a partner. Pressure and possessiveness scare you off instantly.","venus.pisces":"You love tenderly and selflessly and easily idealise the one you hold dear. Beauty, sympathy and softness are your love language. Just make sure you fall for a living person, not an imagined image.","mars.aries":"You act instantly and head-on, full of energy with a short fuse. It is easier for you to charge forward than to endure and wait. In a fight you are honest and direct, if hot-tempered.","mars.taurus":"You get going slowly, but then you push on like a tank, impossible to stop. You get angry rarely and store it up for a long time, but if it bursts, watch out. You win not by a rush but by never giving up.","mars.gemini":"Your energy is scattered: you grab many things and finish them through interest rather than force. You fight and get your way with words, not fists. The main thing for you is not to be bored.","mars.cancer":"You act by mood, and you only get truly fierce when protecting your own. Your anger is indirect: you'd rather walk away hurt than strike head-on. You are strong when there is someone to protect.","mars.leo":"You act on a grand scale and love to win beautifully, in plain sight. Hurt your pride, and you flare up instantly. You have tons of energy when you believe in what you do.","mars.virgo":"You win not by a sudden push but by quality and patience, methodically and precisely. Other people's sloppiness and fuss drive you up the wall. You finish things where others give up.","mars.libra":"It is hard for you to get going alone: you build momentum together with someone. You avoid open conflict, so sometimes the struggle goes on quietly. It is a matter of principle for you that everything is fair.","mars.scorpio":"Your will is iron: you strike rarely, but for sure and to the end. Your desire and anger are deep, underground, powerful. People underestimate you for nothing: you go all the way to victory.","mars.sagittarius":"You rush towards a goal with passion and faith, but scatter yourself across everything at once. You fight more often for an idea and justice than for yourself. You need a meaning worth the effort.","mars.capricorn":"You strike rarely but accurately and for the long term, winning with cold endurance rather than a flash. You can move towards a goal for years without slowing down. In a struggle you are calculating and patient like few others.","mars.aquarius":"You act in your own way and for the sake of an idea, you can't stand orders. Your energy comes in bursts and unpredictably. An unusual challenge gets you going, not a routine fight.","mars.pisces":"A direct attack is not your style: you go around, with intuition and the skill of slipping away. Your anger more often goes inward than outward. You are stronger where flexibility is needed, not a battering ram.","jupiter.aries":"You grow through courage and the first step, luck loves your boldness. The risk is charging off without thinking.","jupiter.taurus":"Abundance comes through patience and the material world: money, comfort, a taste for life.","jupiter.gemini":"You grow through knowledge, connections and conversations. Luck is where there is plenty of information and people.","jupiter.cancer":"Generosity through care and home; you are lucky when you create warmth for others. Jupiter is strong here.","jupiter.leo":"You grow in plain sight: through creativity, generosity and confidence. The world responds to your scale.","jupiter.virgo":"Growth through work, usefulness and craft, little by little but reliably. Modesty bears fruit.","jupiter.libra":"Luck through partnership, fairness and beauty. Alone you grow more slowly than in a union.","jupiter.scorpio":"You grow through crises and depth: what breaks others makes you stronger. You are drawn to secrets and shared resources.","jupiter.sagittarius":"Jupiter at home: faith, space, big goals. Lucky on the road and with meaning, the risk is promising more than there is.","jupiter.capricorn":"Growth that is disciplined and earned, step by step to the top. Luck is a reward for endurance.","jupiter.aquarius":"You grow through ideas, freedom and communities. You are lucky with unusual paths and the right people.","jupiter.pisces":"Jupiter is strong here: growth through compassion, faith and imagination. What you give comes back.","saturn.aries":"The lesson is patience and the skill of not starting in the heat of the moment. You learn to discipline your drive.","saturn.taurus":"Fear of scarcity and of losing ground; the lesson is to build something reliable slowly and not cling to what you have.","saturn.gemini":"You learn to think deeply rather than superficially and to answer for your words. The fear is looking stupid.","saturn.cancer":"Warmth comes through overcoming coldness; the lesson is to allow yourself care and not lock your feelings away.","saturn.leo":"You learn to show yourself without fear of judgement; the lesson is confidence that is earned, not begged for.","saturn.virgo":"Perfectionism as a form of fear; the lesson is to work precisely but forgive yourself for being imperfect.","saturn.libra":"Saturn is strong here: you learn mature relationships and commitments through responsibility.","saturn.scorpio":"The lesson is to let go of control and trust; the fear of betrayal leads to real depth.","saturn.sagittarius":"You learn to back faith with deeds and freedom with responsibility. The fear is ending up in a cage.","saturn.capricorn":"Saturn at home: discipline, endurance and a distant goal are your element. The lesson is that not everything has to be earned.","saturn.aquarius":"Saturn is strong here: you build the new on solid ground, freedom through structure rather than against it.","saturn.pisces":"You learn to ground your dreams and set limits on compassion, so as not to dissolve.","uranus.aries":"A generation of sharp pioneers: freedom is won by push and in spite of everything.","uranus.taurus":"A generation that breaks the rules around money and material things; the change is slow but irreversible.","uranus.gemini":"A generation of revolution in communication and information, new ways of talking and learning.","uranus.cancer":"A generation that rethinks home, family and roots; the familiar nest stops being a given.","uranus.leo":"A generation of bright individuality: the right to be yourself out loud, creativity against templates.","uranus.virgo":"A generation that turns work, health and everyday technology upside down; the new inside the routine.","uranus.libra":"A generation that changes the rules of relationships and marriage, partnership on new terms.","uranus.scorpio":"A generation drawn to depth and taboo, breaking what people keep silent about.","uranus.sagittarius":"A generation of free views: new meanings, faith without dogma, open borders.","uranus.capricorn":"A generation that rebuilds power and institutions; old structures crack.","uranus.aquarius":"Uranus at home: a generation of breakthroughs and technology, freedom and community as the main values.","uranus.pisces":"A generation of blurred borders and new spirituality, an upheaval in faith and art.","neptune.aries":"A generation that dreams through action: ideals people rush towards, sometimes into the fog.","neptune.taurus":"A generation looking for the spiritual in the material and in beauty; illusions around money and ownership.","neptune.gemini":"A generation that dissolves borders in words and information, inspiration and misinformation side by side.","neptune.cancer":"A generation longing for the ideal home and roots; sensitivity to its own people to the point of merging.","neptune.leo":"A generation dreaming of bright creativity and love as a miracle; idols and disappointments.","neptune.virgo":"A generation of ideals of service and health; the risk is dissolving in anxiety about imperfection.","neptune.libra":"A generation of romantics in relationships: the dream of the ideal union, easy to be disappointed.","neptune.scorpio":"A generation fascinated by mystery, power and the forbidden; deep, dark intuition.","neptune.sagittarius":"A generation of spiritual seekers: faith and far horizons, but also escape into illusions of meaning.","neptune.capricorn":"A generation that dissolves old authorities; the dream of rebuilding the very structure of the world.","neptune.aquarius":"A generation of utopias and the common good: the dream of a free humanity, naive in places.","neptune.pisces":"Neptune at home: a generation of fine intuition and compassion, and a tendency to escape reality.","pluto.aries":"A generation of sharp, forceful transformation: power is taken by action and will.","pluto.taurus":"A generation of deep rebuilding of values and resources, what is really yours is tested to the foundations.","pluto.gemini":"A generation that transforms thinking and communication; power and manipulation through words.","pluto.cancer":"A generation that digs up family, roots and the sense of belonging to the very depths.","pluto.leo":"A generation of a powerful self: power, creativity and ego go through rebirth.","pluto.virgo":"A generation that transforms work, health and order; a clean-up for the sake of deep renewal.","pluto.libra":"A generation that remakes relationships and justice: power in couples and in society changes its form.","pluto.scorpio":"Pluto at home: a generation of extreme depth and transformation: birth through crisis.","pluto.sagittarius":"A generation that blows up old meanings and faith; the power of ideas and their destruction.","pluto.capricorn":"A generation of breaking and reassembling power: old structures die so that new ones can be born.","pluto.aquarius":"A generation of transformation through technology and communities, power is redistributed.","pluto.pisces":"A generation of dissolving borders and spiritual rebirth, the old collective dream dies."},"ess":{"sun":{"aries":"a person of action and straight moves","taurus":"a person of reliability, taste and calm strength","gemini":"a person of curiosity, always ready to go","cancer":"a person of care and deep attachment","leo":"a person of warmth, scale and a wish to shine","virgo":"a person of deeds, details and common sense","libra":"a person of harmony, taste and relationships","scorpio":"a person of depth, will and all or nothing","sagittarius":"a person of freedom, space and faith in the best","capricorn":"a person of goals, endurance and long aim","aquarius":"a person on your own wavelength, looking into the future","pisces":"a person of feeling, dreams and a fine soul"},"moon":{"aries":"movement and a quick outlet for feelings","taurus":"peace, warmth and the familiar","gemini":"to talk things through and not be bored","cancer":"closeness, a home and your own people","leo":"to be noticed and appreciated","virgo":"order, so your soul can settle","libra":"agreement and beauty around you","scorpio":"depth and complete reliability next to you","sagittarius":"air, meaning and freedom","capricorn":"support in deeds rather than words","aquarius":"freedom even in closeness","pisces":"silence and a place to recover"},"venus":{"aries":"love with passion and go straight for it","taurus":"love faithfully, physically and reliably","gemini":"love through the mind, flirting and conversation","cancer":"love by caring and protecting","leo":"love generously and a little for show","virgo":"love through care and small things","libra":"love gracefully and as equals","scorpio":"love deeply and without half-tones","sagittarius":"love freely and with a lift","capricorn":"love seriously and for the long run","aquarius":"love unusually and like a friend","pisces":"love tenderly and selflessly"}},"asp0":{"sun.conjunction.moon":"Will and feelings look in the same direction: wholeness, but little inner distance for self-criticism.","sun.opposition.moon":"What you want and what you feel pull in different directions: an eternal inner dialogue.","sun.square.saturn":"A strict inner parent: success comes through overcoming and the feeling of not being good enough.","venus.trine.mars":"Desire and tenderness in harmony: ease in love and in winning over the person you like.","venus.square.mars":"Attraction and friction together: passionate, but with sparks; love as a field of tension.","moon.square.saturn":"Feelings run into an inner critic; warmth comes through overcoming coldness.","mercury.conjunction.sun":"Thought and personality are fused: you say it as it is, but it is hard to look at yourself from outside.","mars.conjunction.jupiter":"Energy and faith overflow: scale and drive, with the risk of overestimating your strength.","moon.trine.venus":"Warmth and charm in agreement: people feel cosy with you, you give and receive tenderness easily.","sun.trine.jupiter":"Inborn optimism and luck: doors open, as long as you are not too lazy to walk through them."},"syn0":{"sun.conjunction.moon":"One is about the self, the other about care; a rare feeling of being from the same planet. One of the warmest links.","venus.conjunction.mars":"Mutual attraction by default: the spark is there at once. The chemistry is strong, the question is whether there is a foundation under it.","venus.trine.venus":"Shared taste and ease in showing tenderness: being together is pleasant without effort.","moon.opposition.saturn":"One needs warmth, the other sets limits without meaning to. It pulls you in and chills at the same time.","sun.square.sun":"Two cores rub against each other: interesting, but you will have to learn not to run each other over.","moon.trine.moon":"Emotionally on the same wave: you feel each other without words, a home builds itself.","mars.square.mars":"You fire each other up both in passion and in quarrels: lots of energy, easy to slip into conflict.","sun.trine.moon":"One person's will and the other's feelings support each other: a calm, nourishing link."},"seed":{"sun.1":"Your personality is on display: you are the message, hard to miss.","sun.2":"Self-esteem is tied to resources; you build yourself through what you own.","sun.3":"You shine in conversation and learning; being heard matters.","sun.4":"The centre of life is home and roots; you bloom in your own place.","sun.5":"You need to create and be noticed; life as a stage.","sun.6":"You live through work and usefulness; meaning is in a job well done.","sun.7":"You find yourself in a couple; the other person is your mirror.","sun.8":"You live deeply, through crises and rebirths; the surface is not for you.","sun.9":"You are defined by the search for meaning, the road, a big idea.","sun.10":"Life pulls you to the top; you are defined by what you do in the world.","sun.11":"You live through a circle of like-minded people and a big goal ahead.","sun.12":"Your self is hidden; you are strong in silence, behind the scenes.","moon.1":"Feelings on the surface; everyone sees your mood at once.","moon.2":"Calm through stability and prosperity; money means safety.","moon.3":"Emotions flow through talk; you need to put feelings into words.","moon.4":"Your emotional centre is home and roots; you need your own nest.","moon.5":"Feelings look for expression in creativity, romance, children.","moon.6":"You calm down through order and caring for your body; chaos makes you anxious.","moon.7":"Your emotional support is a partner; you need an us.","moon.8":"Feelings are deep and hidden; you are drawn to intense experiences.","moon.9":"Your soul needs space, the road, meaning; home feels tight.","moon.10":"Emotions are tied to recognition and status; you are sensitive to judgement.","moon.11":"You find warmth among friends; family means kindred spirits.","moon.12":"Feelings are hidden deep, even from yourself; you need silence and solitude.","mercury.1":"The mind comes first; you think out loud and fast.","mercury.2":"Practical thinking; you count, plan and look for the benefit.","mercury.3":"Mercury at home: talk, learning and your close circle are your element.","mercury.4":"Thoughts revolve around home, family, the past.","mercury.5":"Your mind plays and creates; you think brightly and with passion.","mercury.6":"An analyst by nature; your mind is tuned to details and order.","mercury.7":"You think through dialogue; ideas are born in pairs.","mercury.8":"A detective's mind; you are drawn to dig into secrets and the forbidden.","mercury.9":"You think broadly: in ideas, meanings, distant topics.","mercury.10":"Your mind works towards a goal; you think in strategies.","mercury.11":"Thinking about the future and the common good; ideas for the group.","mercury.12":"Your mind works by intuition; thoughts flow as images.","venus.1":"Charm on display; being liked suits you.","venus.2":"You love the beautiful and reliable; value through ownership.","venus.3":"You fall for minds and words; flirting through conversation.","venus.4":"Love and comfort at home; building a nest matters.","venus.5":"Love through play and romance; being in love suits you.","venus.6":"Tenderness through care and small deeds; love in everyday life.","venus.7":"Venus at home: partnership and harmony in a couple are the centre of life.","venus.8":"Love that is deep and all-consuming; passion on the edge.","venus.9":"You fall for the distant and the different; love as an adventure.","venus.10":"Value and love are linked to status; in plain sight.","venus.11":"Love starts with friendship; warmth among your own.","venus.12":"Love that is secret, self-sacrificing, idealised.","mars.1":"You act directly and visibly; energy through presence.","mars.2":"You fight for resources and stability; persistence in earning.","mars.3":"Energy in words and learning; you argue and persuade.","mars.4":"Drive goes into the home; a fight for your own territory.","mars.5":"You act through creativity, sport, romance; passion.","mars.6":"Energy in work and routine; you win through hard work.","mars.7":"Drive in partnership; both passion and conflict in a couple.","mars.8":"Power in crises and depth; will to the end.","mars.9":"You rush towards distant goals; you fight for your beliefs.","mars.10":"Ambition and drive in your career; you push your way up.","mars.11":"Energy in teams; you fight for the common cause.","mars.12":"Indirect action, from the shadows; strength in what is hidden.","jupiter.1":"You grow through yourself and your charm; luck loves your confidence.","jupiter.2":"Abundance in money; you are lucky with prosperity.","jupiter.3":"Growth through knowledge and connections; luck in communication.","jupiter.4":"Well-being at home and in the family; roots give support.","jupiter.5":"Lucky in creativity, love, children; life is generous with joy.","jupiter.6":"Growth through work and usefulness; luck in craft.","jupiter.7":"Lucky with partners; a union expands you.","jupiter.8":"Growth through crises and shared resources; depth enriches you.","jupiter.9":"Jupiter at home: the road, meaning and faith are your wide luck.","jupiter.10":"Lucky in career and status; the way up is open.","jupiter.11":"Luck through friends; dreams come true with people.","jupiter.12":"Growth in silence and the spiritual; luck comes quietly, from inside.","saturn.1":"Strict with yourself; you grow up early and keep in shape.","saturn.2":"Fear of scarcity; you learn to build prosperity with patience.","saturn.3":"Responsibility for words; you learn to think deeply.","saturn.4":"Heaviness in the roots; you build support with effort.","saturn.5":"Restraint in creativity and love; joy through effort.","saturn.6":"Discipline in work and health; routine is your strong suit.","saturn.7":"Seriousness in partnership; you learn mature commitments.","saturn.8":"Fear of losing control; the lesson is to trust and let go.","saturn.9":"Faith through doubt; you earn meaning through work.","saturn.10":"Saturn at home: career is a school of patience, success comes late but lasts.","saturn.11":"Responsibility in the community; few friends, but for years.","saturn.12":"Fears from the unconscious; the lesson is to meet them in silence.","uranus.1":"You are not like everyone else; the freedom to be yourself is your nerve.","uranus.2":"Unusual with money; income comes in bursts and in your own way.","uranus.3":"An original mind; you think in leaps and outside the box.","uranus.4":"You break family patterns; an unusual home.","uranus.5":"Creativity and love outside the rules; you are drawn to experiment.","uranus.6":"A revolution in work and everyday life; you can't stand routine.","uranus.7":"Freedom in relationships matters more than form; unusual unions.","uranus.8":"Sudden changes through crises; interest in the forbidden.","uranus.9":"Your own views and faith; rebellion against dogma.","uranus.10":"An unusual path up; a career in leaps.","uranus.11":"Communities and the future are your element; unusual friends.","uranus.12":"Insights out of nowhere; freedom comes from within.","neptune.1":"Your image is blurred and changing; people see you differently.","neptune.2":"Fog around money; values that are ideal rather than material.","neptune.3":"Imaginative thinking; facts slip away, intuition leads.","neptune.4":"You idealise home and roots; a longing for the real thing.","neptune.5":"Creativity and love as a dream; inspiration and illusions.","neptune.6":"Service at work; the risk of dissolving in caring for others.","neptune.7":"You idealise your partner; love as rescue or deception.","neptune.8":"Fine intuition for the hidden; you are drawn beyond the edge.","neptune.9":"Faith and a dream of meaning; a spiritual search without borders.","neptune.10":"Your calling is hazy; you are drawn to art or service.","neptune.11":"Dreams of the common good; ideal, naive hopes.","neptune.12":"Neptune at home: intuition, dreams and spirituality are your secret strength.","pluto.1":"A powerful presence; you are reborn through yourself.","pluto.2":"Power through resources; crises change your values.","pluto.3":"A piercing mind; words as a weapon.","pluto.4":"Deep shifts in the family; family secrets.","pluto.5":"Passion in creativity and love; everything at the limit.","pluto.6":"Transformation through work and the body; a clean-up for renewal.","pluto.7":"Power and depth in partnership; unions transform you.","pluto.8":"Pluto at home: crisis, depth and rebirth are your element.","pluto.9":"You break and rebuild meanings and faith.","pluto.10":"Power in your career; a path through crisis to the top.","pluto.11":"Influence in groups; you transform the community.","pluto.12":"Hidden strength from the unconscious; rebirth in silence."},"ap":{"sun":"express yourself openly","moon":"feel grounded","mercury":"speak clearly","venus":"build closeness","mars":"act boldly","jupiter":"broaden your horizons","saturn":"keep your word","uranus":"explore something new","neptune":"follow your imagination","pluto":"get to the heart of things"},"ah":{"conjunction":["Your wish to {A} is closely tied to your wish to {B}","It is hard for you to separate the wish to {A} from the urge to {B}","Two strong impulses meet in you: to {A} and to {B}","When you want to {A}, the wish to {B} shows up almost at once"],"opposition":["You can be pulled between wanting to {A} and wanting to {B}","When you want to {A}, you want just as much to {B}","In one situation it matters to you to {A}, in another it matters just as much to {B}","Balancing the wish to {A} with the need to {B} is not always easy"],"square":["It matters to you to {A}, but the urge to {B} sometimes throws you off course","Trying to {A} can clash with an equally strong wish to {B}","Inner tension grows when you try to {A} and {B} at the same time","It can be hard to {A} while you are also trying to {B}"],"trine":["You often manage to {A} and {B} at the same time","It comes fairly naturally to you to {A} without losing the ability to {B}","When you can {A}, it also gets easier to {B}","The ways you {A} and {B} support each other well"],"sextile":["When you try to {A}, a good chance appears to {B}","The wish to {A} can open a new way for you to {B}","You have a chance to link two skills: to {A} and to {B}","If you start small and try to {A}, it gets easier to {B}"]},"at":["Notice which of the two impulses is leading you right now before you agree to a new plan.","Try to give room to both sides instead of declaring one of them wrong.","Start with a small step, then the inner argument won't eat all your energy.","Don't hide this easy skill, it is especially useful when everything around gets complicated.","The chance opens up when you take the first step.","It helps to look at these wishes separately sometimes, so you don't mistake one for the other.","The contradiction softens when you name both needs out loud.","Irritation here often points to a task that is time to solve for real.","What comes naturally is also worth developing instead of taking it for granted.","A little experience is enough to see how to connect these sides of life.","If you stop for a minute, it becomes clearer where the decision came from.","You don't have to choose forever, sometimes a decision for today is enough.","Leave yourself the right to redo the plan if the first attempt didn't work.","In a calm setting you can notice how one supports the other.","A conversation or a new habit can turn this chance into a real skill.","A strong response doesn't always require immediate action, give yourself time to choose.","Look for a meeting point between the wishes, not a winner in this argument.","A pause before answering helps keep a difficulty from turning into a quarrel with yourself.","Trust this move, but now and then check that you are not running on habit.","Try without pressure, this kind of skill grows with practice.","When everything happens at once, a short pause helps you hear your own answer.","Someone else's view can show you a side of yourself that is hard to notice alone.","This strength can be put to work if you pick one task instead of ten.","You have a reserve of simplicity here that helps you not overcomplicate choices.","Don't wait for the perfect moment, a gentle attempt already starts the movement."],"sa":{"sun":"self-expression","moon":"need for safety","mercury":"way of talking","venus":"way of showing affection","mars":"drive to act","jupiter":"wish to grow","saturn":"sense of boundaries","uranus":"urge for change","neptune":"imagination","pluto":"wish to control everything"},"st":{"sun":"self-expression","moon":"emotional safety","mercury":"communication","venus":"affection","mars":"initiative","jupiter":"growth","saturn":"boundaries","uranus":"change","neptune":"dreams","pluto":"trust and control"},"sh":{"conjunction":["One person's {A} is closely tied to how the other deals with {BT}"],"opposition":["One person's {A} and the other's {B} can pull you in different directions"],"square":["Friction appears when one person's {A} runs into how the other deals with {BT}"],"trine":["One person's {A} easily finds an echo in how the other deals with {BT}"],"sextile":["You have a chance to connect one person's {A} with how the other deals with {BT}"]},"ss":{"conjunction":["You see questions of {T} in a similar way, so what is familiar in the other strikes a chord quickly"],"opposition":["{T} matters equally to both of you, but you may look at it from different sides"],"square":["The theme of {T} touches you both, but your usual reactions may not match"],"trine":["You see questions of {T} in a similar way and don't have to explain yourselves again each time"],"sextile":["You see questions of {T} in a similar way, and new things open up through shared experience"]},"stl":["You quickly recognise yourselves in each other, but still ask what each of you means.","The difference can attract, as long as you don't turn it into a competition.","Don't collect small jabs, better talk through one specific case.","It is easy for you to support each other, especially in ordinary daily things.","One good conversation can show you a new way of being together.","Closeness comes easily if you don't assume your hidden expectations are the same.","Ask each other about motives before you start defending yourselves.","In an argument it helps more to name your request than to guess the other's intent.","This simplicity is valuable, don't forget to say out loud what is working.","There is a chance to grow closer if each of you takes at least a small step.","It helps to leave each other room for a separate view.","A conversation where both positions get to be heard to the end will help.","Tension eases when you change the pace and let each other finish speaking.","You find a common rhythm without long explanations, but questions still help.","A shared project will help you understand each other better than long guesses.","Such similarity brings you closer when you hear not only the familiar but also the new.","Don't rush to decide who is right, each of you has your own angle here.","A simple rule will help: first clarify, then answer.","Warm agreement helps you get through days when strength is low.","Your connection opens up gradually, through attention to small things.","It is easier to agree if each of you gets to put your wish into words.","Balance appears between you when both are ready to move a little.","A disagreement can become an honest talk if you don't hit sore spots.","Your understanding grows stronger when you share even small successes.","Try a new shared ritual, the bond here grows through repetition."],"hp":{"sun":["It is easier for you to stay yourself when you don't have to play a convenient role","Approval from others is nice, but your own choice gives firmer support","Your confidence grows when the decision is really yours"],"moon":["A warm connection with yourself starts with a simple question about how you feel","It is easier to move on when you don't brush off your feelings","Don't brush off the first feeling, it may tell you what you are missing right now"],"mercury":["A clear question sometimes helps you more than a ready answer","Your curiosity pays off if you give yourself time to check what you heard","One precise question can clear up half the misunderstandings"],"venus":["Warmth is easier to keep when you don't agree to what you don't like","Notice what makes you happy and what you choose for someone else's approval","It helps to remember your own taste, even next to people you love"],"mars":["Before speeding up, make clear what you really want to fight for","Your energy needs an outlet that doesn't turn every disagreement into a battle","A direct talk often saves more strength than silent irritation"],"jupiter":["A big plan works better when it has a first doable step","Curiosity takes you further if you keep real deadlines and strength in mind","It is easier to trust a big idea when its next step is visible"],"saturn":["You can hold the course, but you don't have to carry all the responsibility alone","Reliability doesn't require you to pick the hardest path every time","Your discipline helps if it leaves room for rest"],"uranus":["There is more freedom when you understand the price of a change","Changes become more fruitful when you know what exactly you want to improve","Your fresh idea will work better if you explain to others what it changes"],"neptune":["Imagination shows the direction, and checking the facts helps you not get lost","An unusual feeling is worth writing down and later comparing with what is really happening","A subtle impression can be useful if you don't pass it off as a fact right away"],"pluto":["A hard question doesn't have to be solved with one sharp move","A deep talk goes better when there is room for the other person's truth too","You don't have to control everything for a change to be real"]},"hh":{"1":"when you meet people who don't know you yet.","2":"when you decide what to spend your energy and money on.","3":"when an ordinary conversation suddenly becomes important.","4":"when old family habits make themselves felt.","5":"when you want to show the world what is dear to you.","6":"when the to-do list seems endless again.","7":"when your wishes and the other person's diverge.","8":"when the talk turns to what you are afraid to lose.","9":"when you meet someone else's view of familiar things.","10":"when people expect results from you in plain sight.","11":"when the group moves faster than is comfortable for you.","12":"when it is calm outside but still noisy inside."},"hj":", especially ","fc":{"mood.amplified":["Everything feels brighter than usual today. Pick what you really want to give your energy to.","You catch fire with ideas faster and infect others more easily. Check that you have some air between tasks.","The day seems to turn up the volume of your wishes. Don't promise more than you will want to do tomorrow.","You may have a rare sense of clarity: right now you can see what you yourself want.","Impressions hit harder than usual, so even a short walk can clear your head.","Today it is easy to hear your own rhythm. Remember which activities give you energy and which only make noise.","Emotions come fast and noticeably. Give them a name before you make a decision.","You want to keep moving without a pause, but the best moment of the day may come in a quiet gap."],"mood.harmonious":["The day unfolds softly, and it is easier for you to agree even on small things.","Your mood evens out where there is familiar order and pleasant people.","Today you don't need to push yourself every minute. Things can move at a steady pace.","A good day for a simple joy you have long put off.","An ordinary conversation can leave a warm trace. Don't rush past it.","You may enjoy a calm pace without trying to do everything at once.","Today it is easier to notice what is already working. Let yourself enjoy it.","The day invites attention: to yourself, to another person's words, to small details."],"mood.tense":["The rhythm of the day may irritate you, especially if plans change without warning. Leave a little room between tasks.","You may react more sharply to small things. Not every delay means a big problem.","Today it is better to lower the noise around you before dealing with a hard question.","Someone else's pace may not match yours. Say directly how much time you need.","If your mood jumps around, don't demand that you calm down right away.","The day asks for patience with ordinary glitches. One thing at a time is already a good move.","Your schedule may feel tight. Find at least a short pause without a screen.","Right now it is easy to mistake tiredness for a bad feeling. Check the simplest reasons first."],"week.amplified":["The week picks up your ideas faster than usual. Choose one you can bring to a result.","In the coming days you will want to expand your plans. Write down new thoughts, but don't fill every free minute with them.","Your enthusiasm can open a conversation that has long been missing.","This week a lot will become more visible: both wishes and the limits of your strength. Take both signals into account.","A good time to show a draft to someone whose view you trust.","It is easier for you to gather people around a shared idea. Leave everyone room for their own voice.","Days full of impressions are ahead. Set aside time to understand what is worth continuing.","The week may start with a strong impulse. Turn it into a small repeatable action."],"week.harmonious":["The week suits gradual progress. A good rhythm matters more than a sprint.","Over a few days you can calmly close an issue that has long been hanging in the background.","Meetings and work talks may go more easily if you come with a clear request.","This week leaves room for habits that help you stay in shape.","The middle of the week may be a good moment to return to a postponed idea.","It is easier for you to see the link between small steps. Don't underestimate it.","If you have long wanted to sort out your plans, start with one list.","In the coming days calm agreements may turn out to be the most valuable."],"week.tense":["The week may require a backup plan. Leave room for delays in your schedule.","Don't try to fit all the tasks into one day, even if the start of the week feels lively.","When talking about deadlines, better clarify details right away than sort out a misunderstanding later.","In the coming days old matters may remind you of themselves. Choose what really needs an answer.","A simple priority will help: important first, loud second.","If plans shift, it is a reason to rebuild the route, not to scold yourself.","The week may be uneven. Short finished tasks will help bring back a sense of support.","Not every request has to become your task. Check where you can say no."],"love.amplified":["Affection sounds louder today. Say it simply, without testing the other's reaction.","You want more warmth and attention. Start with an honest talk about what is missing.","A chance meeting may hook you harder than usual. Don't rush to invent its continuation.","If you have been together a long time, make a small gesture of attention for no special reason.","Your feelings may run ahead of your words. Give yourself time to find the ones that really fit.","Flirting comes easily today if you don't try to play someone else's role.","You want closeness and a bright response. Ask the other person how their day is going.","You may understand more clearly who you want next to you and why."],"love.harmonious":["A warm talk is easier to start with a simple everyday detail than with a big confession.","Today it is easy to agree on time for each other, even if the day is busy.","Attention to small things will say more about feelings than a loud gesture.","If you have long wanted to write to someone, start without searching for the perfect phrase.","A calm sense of being a team may appear in your couple. Say thanks for what usually goes unnoticed.","It is easier to hear the other when you don't have to defend yourself at the same time.","The day suits a walk or a talk without the task of deciding anything.","Love today may look very simple: show up on time, ask, listen."],"love.tense":["You may lack attention, but guessing at someone's motives will only add noise. Ask directly.","If an ordinary joke hurt, say so without blaming.","Today it is better to postpone a serious talk if you are both worn out.","Different wishes for the evening don't make you strangers. Find a way to take both into account.","Old irritation may surface over a small thing. Talk about the real cause when you have the strength.","Don't read silence as a final answer. Maybe the person needs time.","You may want to close up before an important phrase is said. Try to hear it out.","If closeness is hard today, start with simple care without demanding something back right away."],"work.amplified":["A hard task may unexpectedly grab you. Leave time to write down a working thought while it is fresh.","Today you want to take the initiative. First make clear what result the team needs.","You see a possible way forward faster. Check the details before announcing the plan is ready.","A good moment to suggest an idea you have been carrying around for a long time.","You may feel bolder talking about your work. Back your words with a concrete example.","The day suits a push in one task, as long as you don't scatter across five directions.","Your interest is visible to others. Show them where they can join in.","A strong wish to redo everything at once is better aimed at one visible knot."],"work.harmonious":["Today is good for closing tasks that lacked a calm hour.","A work talk will go more easily if you start with the goal rather than a list of problems.","Check old notes, there may be a ready hint among them.","A small process improvement will save more energy than an extra sprint.","It is easier to agree on help with a colleague if the request is specific.","The day suits careful work where attention matters more than speed.","You can calmly go back to a draft and see what already works.","A good moment to clarify the next step and remove extra uncertainty."],"work.tense":["If tasks pour in one after another, start with the one that has a clear deadline.","Double-check the agreement in writing, especially if the talk was on the run.","Someone else's urgency may knock your plan off. Clarify what is really needed today.","When things stall, separate missing data from tiredness.","Don't promise an instant answer if you need to figure things out first.","Today it helps to save an intermediate result, even if the work isn't finished.","An argument about method is easier to settle on a small example than in general words.","If your attention drifts, remove one distraction and go back to the main task."],"money.amplified":["Today it is easy to get excited about a purchase. Give yourself an hour to see if you'll still need it tomorrow.","You feel like investing in a new idea. First write down the full cost and timing.","You may see more clearly what you want to pay for and what no longer brings joy.","A talk about money is better started with numbers, even if the decision isn't made yet.","You feel generous. Check that the amount is comfortable for you without expecting anything back.","A new opportunity looks tempting. Read the terms before making plans.","You have enough energy to sort out one long-postponed money detail.","You may want something new. Compare a few options without hurrying."],"money.harmonious":["A calm day to look at your usual spending without self-criticism.","A little clarity in the numbers can noticeably ease your near-term plans.","If a purchase has long been planned, today is good for checking the details.","It is easier for you to tell a useful thing from a passing wish.","A couple of minutes reviewing subscriptions can bring back a sense of order.","A talk about a shared budget will be easier if you start with a concrete goal.","You can calmly reconsider the price of your time and effort.","A good moment to write down payments you don't want to remember on the last day."],"money.tense":["If a price suddenly changes, take a pause and check the terms.","Today it is easy to buy something out of irritation. Postpone the decision at least until evening.","Don't sign up for a new expense just because someone is rushing you.","Small expenses may annoy you more than usual. Look at the big picture.","If something in the numbers is unclear, better ask one direct question.","The day suits checking, not deciding on emotions.","Shared money needs a clear talk: who, how much and by when.","Don't compare your budget with someone else's shop window. Go back to your own goals."],"health.amplified":["You may have more energy than usual. Save some for the evening rather than spending it all in the first rush.","Your body asks for movement you enjoy, without competing with yourself.","If the day picks up speed, don't forget water and short breaks.","A good moment to notice after which activities you feel more alive.","Strength is coming, but rest is still needed. Plan it together with your tasks.","You may want to change your usual routine. Start small and see how you respond.","The day suits a walk that helps clear your head.","If you feel a surge of energy, direct it into taking care of yourself, not only into new tasks."],"health.harmonious":["Your usual rhythm may turn out to be the most comfortable today.","A small break between tasks will help you hear your own needs better.","A calm walk without a goal or a step counter may do you good.","The day suits simple care: eat on time and go to bed without extra rush.","Notice what helps you recover and leave room for it in your schedule.","A light stretch can make the workday more pleasant.","Today it is easier not to argue with your body when it needs a softer pace.","A good moment to bring back one handy habit you dropped by accident."],"health.tense":["If you feel tired, cut optional tasks and give yourself a breather.","A tense day is not a good reason to ignore food, water and sleep.","A quiet pause without your phone may help, even if it lasts only a few minutes.","If your body asks to slow down, listen before taking on something new.","Check whether you have been holding your shoulders tense for hours.","Better choose movement you can manage than scold yourself for a missed workout.","Today it is especially useful to finish work at the agreed time.","Don't try to beat tiredness with willpower. Rest is part of the day too."],"advice":["Name one thing you can do today and start with it.","Check whether you have taken on someone else's urgency.","Ask directly about what you are trying to guess.","Give yourself ten minutes of silence before an important answer.","Write down a good thought, even if you don't know yet where to use it.","Go back to a conversation that broke off mid-sentence.","Do one small part of a big task.","Let the plan change if new facts have appeared.","Thank someone for specific help.","Check your own wish before agreeing.","Remove one distraction from your desk or screen.","Leave the evening freer than your to-do list suggests.","If you are unsure, phrase the question more precisely.","Don't devalue a task just because it was solved quickly.","Talk about deadlines before they start to press.","Walk where you usually drive past.","Notice that today has already become a little easier.","Put off an extra purchase until tomorrow and compare how you feel.","Say no to one task there is no room for right now.","Choose a comfortable pace, even if someone nearby is rushing.","Ask for clarification if someone's words sounded ambiguous.","Bring back a small habit that used to work well.","Start a meeting with the main point so it doesn't get lost in details.","Don't wait for inspiration, try for five minutes and decide then.","Let the person finish before you prepare your answer.","Leave a short note for tomorrow while the details are fresh.","Pause between a notification and your reaction.","Choose one conversation that will make the day clearer.","Compare today's step with yourself yesterday, not with someone else's result.","End the day with one simple thing that gives you peace."]}};
